---
description: Next.js admin-web rules for apps/admin-web/
globs: apps/admin-web/**
---

Full rules in `docs/rules/admin-web.md`. Key points:

- Feature-first CA: `features/<name>/{data,domain,presentation}`
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity
- Auth: httpOnly JWT cookies; middleware checks `role === 'admin'`
- Cookie name: `owezy_access_token`
- BFF auth routes at `app/api/auth/{refresh,logout}`
- Design tokens from `packages/design-system/` only — no raw hex/rem/px
- Design fidelity: read `resources/owezy-admin-console/` mocks before UI
- **Localization required:** UI copy from `src/core/i18n/` catalogs via `t()`; no hardcoded strings
